==Trivia==
*This is the only stage that doesn't include any zombies in this sub-chapter.
*The stage name pays homage to the 1980's action comedy film [[wikipedia:Beverly Hills Cop|''Beverly Hills Cop'']], which involves a detective investigating his best friend's death in Beverly Hills.

